Description: Reads this computer and explains what it finds
 SupportOne looks at a computer and reports its health in plain language:
 disk space, memory, security posture, updates, startup programs and more.
 .
 It is read-only by default. It changes nothing without describing the exact
 change and waiting for confirmation, every repair it offers has a working
 undo, and it makes no outbound connection unless someone clicks to send
 something. There is no telemetry.
